{
  "campaign": "c06-mtp",
  "notes": [
    "Speculative decoding with the model's own MTP head (--mtp N) on one MI250X GCD: objective",
    "(5), and the engine work of roadmap 0.8-Z2 measured on the HPC side. One slot, as --mtp needs.",
    "mtp-graded: GSM8K at temperature 0 (ReflexBench's greedy, reproducible requests), so the",
    "answers must be the same with and without drafts, and single-stream speed is read on real",
    "prompts. mtp-throughput: the Leonardo prompt at the engine's default sampling, which is what",
    "a user gets, and where fewer drafts are kept.",
    "GGUFs that keep the MTP layers: unsloth's *-MTP-GGUF repositories, Apache-2.0; sizes from the",
    "Hub API, 06-10-2026: 9B Q4_K_M 5.5 GiB, Q8_0 9.1; 27B Q4_K_M 15.9, Q8_0 27.1; 35B-A3B",
    "UD-Q4_K_M 21.1, Q8_0 35.2 (~114 GiB in all)."
  ],
  "pull": [
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-MTP-GGUF:Q4_K_M",
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-MTP-GGUF:Q8_0",
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-GGUF:Q4_K_M",
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.6-27B-MTP-GGUF:Q8_0",
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-MTP-GGUF:UD-Q4_K_M",
    "hf.co/unsloth/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-MTP-GGUF:Q8_0"
  ],
  "defaults": {"gcds": 1, "batch": 1, "slot_ctx": 8192},
  "groups": [
    {"name": "mtp-graded", "priority": 70, "est_s": 3600,
     "set": {"kind": "workload", "sets": ["gsm8k"], "limit": 300, "concurrency": 1,
             "max_tokens": 768, "think": false},
     "axes": {"model": ["qwen3.5-9b-mtp-gguf-q4_k_m", "qwen3.5-9b-mtp-gguf-q8_0",
                        "qwen3.6-27b-mtp-gguf-q4_k_m", "qwen3.6-27b-mtp-gguf-q8_0",
                        "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp-gguf-ud-q4_k_m", "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp-gguf-q8_0"],
              "extra_args": [["--fit-strict"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "1"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "2"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "3"]]}},

    {"name": "mtp-throughput", "priority": 70, "est_s": 900,
     "set": {"kind": "throughput", "repeats": 3},
     "axes": {"model": ["qwen3.5-9b-mtp-gguf-q4_k_m", "qwen3.5-9b-mtp-gguf-q8_0",
                        "qwen3.6-27b-mtp-gguf-q4_k_m", "qwen3.6-27b-mtp-gguf-q8_0",
                        "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp-gguf-ud-q4_k_m", "qwen3.6-35b-a3b-mtp-gguf-q8_0"],
              "extra_args": [["--fit-strict"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "1"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "2"],
                             ["--fit-strict", "--mtp", "3"]]}}
  ]
}
